== Trivia ==
*The '''Jerry Pet''' is one of the only pets that gives negative stats, along with the {{Item|Rift Ferret Pet}}.
*The '''Jerry Pet''' is also one of the few pets that has the exact same stats from {{Common}} to {{Epic}}.
*Prior to version 0.18.3, the '''Jerry Pet''' had to hold the {{Item|Jerry 3D Glasses}} to be {{Mythic}} rarity.
**Any '''Jerry Pets''' still holding the item when the update released were instantly upgraded to {{Mythic}} and had their Jerry 3D Glasses removed.

